#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# dirac_delta

#% text
# `dirac_delta(x)` represents the Dirac delta function.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# It is 0 at nonzero real numbers and stays unevaluated otherwise.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
dirac_delta(2)
#% output
#= 0

#% cell
dirac_delta(0)
#% output
#= dirac_delta(0)

#% cell
dirac_delta(x)
#% output
#= dirac_delta(x)

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `heaviside_theta`, `unit_step`
